@startuml
!include ../../_theme.puml
title Fingerprint Recording
left to right direction

rectangle "Package Byte Hash" as Bytes
rectangle "Dependency Graph Hash" as Graph
rectangle "Kernel Artifact Hash" as Kernels
rectangle "Toolchain Envelope Proof" as Toolchain
rectangle "Vapor.lock" as Lock

Bytes --> Lock : writes content hash into
Graph --> Lock : writes graph hash into
Kernels --> Lock : writes native hash into
Toolchain --> Lock : writes compatibility proof into
@enduml
